      {label:"Pressure-test the security claim before trusting it.", text:"If you work in security, treat 'most advanced cyber model' as a testable claim, not a feature. Run it on your own defensive workflows — triage, log analysis, patch suggestions — and measure. The token-efficiency angle matters most where you run these at volume."},
      {label:"Route by tier, not by habit.", text:"Three models means three price points. Push high-volume, low-stakes work to Luna and reserve Sol for the tasks that need it — the same discipline that separates a sane AI bill from a scary one."}
